@startuml reroll
title MenuOrchestrator.reroll_timeslot() — main outcomes
actor User
participant CLI
participant MenuOrchestrator as App
participant Menu
participant MealBlockGenerator as Generator
participant AvailableRecipeList as Available
participant RecipeRepository as Recipes
participant RecipeExclusions as Exclusions
participant MenuEditor as Editor
participant SystemExclusions as System

User -> CLI : choose a TimeSlot
CLI -> App : reroll_timeslot(menu, target_timeslot)

alt replacement and exclusion reconstruction succeed
  App -> Menu : get_mealblock(target_timeslot)
  Menu --> App : current MealBlock
  App -> Generator : generate_replacement_mealblock(current_block.length)
  Generator -> Available : generate_available_recipe_list()
  Available -> Recipes : list_recipes()
  Recipes --> Available : recipes
  loop for each recipe
    Available -> Exclusions : is_excluded(recipe.id)
    Exclusions --> Available : bool
  end
  Available --> Generator : non-excluded recipes
  Generator -> Generator : keep recipes where number_meals == block_length
  Generator --> App : replacement MealBlock of matching length
  App -> Editor : reroll(menu, target_timeslot, new_mealblock)
  Editor -> Menu : replace every occurrence of current MealBlock
  Editor --> App : return after stability check
  App -> System : clear()
  App -> Menu : get_unique_mealblocks()
  Menu --> App : unique MealBlock[]
  loop for each unique MealBlock
    App -> System : add_system_exclusion(block.recipe_snapshot.id)
  end
  App --> CLI : MenuOrchestratorResult(success=True, menu=menu)
else ValueError before menu mutation
  note right of App
    An unplanned TimeSlot or no available recipe matching
    the required block length can cause this outcome.
    Menu and SystemExclusions remain unchanged.
  end note
  App --> CLI : MenuOrchestratorResult(success=False, menu=menu)
else unexpected exception before menu mutation
  note right of App
    Repository access or another pre-mutation step may fail.
    Menu and SystemExclusions remain unchanged.
  end note
  App --> CLI : MenuOrchestratorResult(success=False, menu=menu)
end
CLI --> User : display result

note right of Editor
Selecting one TimeSlot rerolls its entire MealBlock,
including every slot of a multi-meal block. MenuEditor
mutates the existing Menu in place. Exclusion rebuilding
is separate; no general rollback exists after mutation
begins, so a later exception may leave partial state.
end note
@enduml
